{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50014","headline":"句 · 崔致远","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画角声中朝暮浪，青山影里古今人。\n烟低紫陌千行柳，日暮朱楼一曲歌。\n洛水波声新草树，嵩山云影旧楼台。\n云布长天龙势逸，风高秋月雁行齐。\n风递莺声喧座上，日移花影倒林中。\n芳园醉散花盈袖，幽迳吟归月在帷。\n极目远山烟外暮，伤心归棹月边迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}